---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";

const description =
  "Joshua Young is from Cincinnati and lives in San Francisco, where he builds Faber. He studied computer science and classical languages at Duke.";
---

<Base title="About" description={description}>
  <h1 class="page-title">About</h1>
  <div class="prose">
    <p>
      I'm from Cincinnati. I live in San Francisco, where I build <a href="https://getfaber.co" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">Faber</a>.
    </p>
    <p>
      Before that I was a software engineer at Clearview AI, working on photo ingestion,
      investigation profiles, and link analysis. Before that I was at Clear Street in New York,
      building the system clients use for corporate actions and the end-of-day processing behind
      prime brokerage.
    </p>
    <p>
      I studied computer science and classical languages at Duke. I was a teaching assistant for
      computer architecture and operating systems.
    </p>
    <p>
      After Clear Street I traveled on my own for a couple of years. I ran the Boston Marathon in
      2:39:56 and the Athens Marathon, trekked to Everest Base Camp and across the Three Passes,
      and climbed Chimborazo and Cotopaxi. I went to the 2022 World Cup in Qatar, two weddings in
      India, and five World Wonders: the Colosseum, Chichén Itzá, Machu Picchu, Petra, and the Taj
      Mahal.
    </p>
    <p>
      More of what I've built is on the <a href="/work">work page</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</Base>
